Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:04.05,TL,,0,0,0,,年初 她止步布里斯班{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.05,0:00:06.61,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网决赛 决胜盘{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:10.06,TL,,0,0,0,,她却以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}逆转 赢下冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:21.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Rybakina. It's Elena Rybakina who moves ahead in this final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜在决赛中取得领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:26.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She gets the important break and leads 4-3. Final set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N关键破发 决胜盘四比三领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:29.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she has been so impressive{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的表现一直如此出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:31.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}second half of last season,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从上个赛季的后半程
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.43,0:00:35.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and now lifting the trophy{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N到如今举起冠军奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:37.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}at the first major of this new season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在新赛季的首站大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:41.17,TL,,0,0,0,,多哈止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强 迪拜因病退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:44.59,TL,,0,0,0,,来到印第安维尔斯 她又打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:48.41,TL,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜握有冠军点 却没能拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:50.28,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘抢七{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}8{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:52.26,TL,,0,0,0,,她输给萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:02.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Third time is a charm for Aryna Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第三次 萨巴伦卡终于做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:08.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}As revenge is served.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她完成了复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:10.44,TL,,0,0,0,,迈阿密半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:12.87,TL,,0,0,0,,萨巴伦卡再次让她止步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:14.36,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月的斯图加特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:16.32,TL,,0,0,0,,她先挽救两个赛点过关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:19.14,TL,,0,0,0,,最终在决赛击败穆霍娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:28.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a second Stuttgart title for Elena Rybakina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜第{\fs78}2{\fs68}次在斯图加特夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:34.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, it's a very attractive tournament in every sense of the word.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这项赛事各方面都很有吸引力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:36.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Overall, as I say,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N总的来说 正如我所说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:39.16,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think I'm on a good path right now,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我觉得自己走在正确的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and we are doing a good job with the team,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我和团队的工作也做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:44.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so I'm just hoping not to stop{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以我希望继续前进
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.43,0:01:45.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and do even better.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N表现得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:49.72,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里第四轮出局 罗马止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.73,TL,,0,0,0,,来到法网 她先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:55.54,TL,,0,0,0,,却输掉决胜盘抢七 止步第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:11.14,TL,,0,0,0,,草地赛季 女王杯打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:12.94,TL,,0,0,0,,柏林第二轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:16.91,TL,,0,0,0,,回到温网 她在第三轮输给梅尔滕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.15,0:02:26.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The world number two is out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第二出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:32.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A huge upset here on Number One Court.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一号球场爆出大冷门
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:34.29,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月 多伦多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:37.26,TL,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜连续逆转大坂直美和高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:39.62,TL,,0,0,0,,再次走进决赛 最后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.62,0:02:41.69,TL,,0,0,0,,她输给斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:57.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sensational Swiatek takes the title in Toronto.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克表现惊艳 拿下多伦多冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:01.67,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛 两人又相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:05.32,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 莱巴金娜因伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:08.57,TL,,0,0,0,,到了纽约 对郑钦文 对高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.57,0:03:10.87,TL,,0,0,0,,她都是先丢一盘后逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.87,0:03:13.61,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 又是萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:16.22,TL,,0,0,0,,今年第三次在决赛相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.12,TL,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜用{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:20.85,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下本赛季第二座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:34.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match for Rybakina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 莱巴金娜获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.93,0:03:36.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two sets to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N盘数二比一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:38.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six four, five seven, six two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N六比四 五比七 六比二
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.35,0:03:45.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a year to finish with two Grand Slam trophies.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一年 以两座大满贯奖杯收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:50.38,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}日 {\fs78}WTA{\fs68}正式确认 莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:53.73,TL,,0,0,0,,是本届年终的首位单打入围者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.18,0:03:57.44,TL,,0,0,0,,也是这一天 她正式登上世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:04:00.35,TL,,0,0,0,,但这个赛季 还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:03.01,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}日 她因医疗原因
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:05.24,TL,,0,0,0,,退出金杯总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.69,0:04:07.75,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}3{\fs68}日 北京
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.75,0:04:10.46,TL,,0,0,0,,她以世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}身份出战的首场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:12.65,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是恰拉耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:24.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Alina Charaeva manufactures a lifelong dream in real time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N恰拉耶娃此刻实现毕生梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:28.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Achieves a majestic, career-defining victory in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在北京赢下生涯标志性胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:31.44,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢一盘 再丢两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:35.23,TL,,0,0,0,,中网第二轮 成了她这一站的终点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:38.54,TL,,0,0,0,,第二天 她又因伤退出武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.76,TL,,0,0,0,,两座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:42.66,TL,,0,0,0,,也不能替她免去恢复的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.91,TL,,0,0,0,,去年 宁波夺冠后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:47.72,TL,,0,0,0,,她在东京赶上年终末班车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:51.48,TL,,0,0,0,,随后五战全胜 在利雅得封后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:55.13,TL,,0,0,0,,今年 两夺大满贯 登顶世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:57.54,TL,,0,0,0,,她又回到宁波卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:11.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Elena Rybakina goes back-to-back in Ningbo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜在宁波成功卫冕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:16.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another statement from the world number one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第一再次展现实力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:21.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she claims yet another title in what has been an extraordinary season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N非凡赛季 她又收获一座冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:23.78,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it's already a second year here,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是我第二年来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:24.64,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}second win,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是第二次夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:26.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it's such a special place for me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这里对我而言如此特别
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:29.60,TL,,0,0,0,,这一程腾飞 从宁波开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:32.56,TL,,0,0,0,,年终 她还能再次捧杯吗？
